    "proof": "Every Chen prime p has p+2 either prime or composite semiprime, giving the disjoint identity C_2=T_0+S_2. Infinitely many Chen primes are unbounded and therefore occupy infinitely many dyadic blocks. The squarefree-Lambda detector of TICKET-199 has exactly the twin-prime support, hence its positivity is equivalent to T_0>0, not merely C_2>0.",
